al inside ```CodeEdit``` when folding/unfolding and in the ```ScriptEditor``` we call ``` _update_background_color()``` on its signal ?\r\nIt would remove the multiple explicit independent calls of ```_update_background_color()``` from the script editor.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2888255291/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2888461529","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106441#issuecomment-2888461529","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106441","id":2888461529,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sKmzZ","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-17T15:35:43Z","updated_at":"2025-05-17T15:36:24Z","body":"> I have another proposal : What do you think if we emit a signal inside `CodeEdit` when folding/unfolding and in the `ScriptEditor` we call ` _update_bac